.PP
.nf
Dump the complete stream into a file or file-like object\&.
Per default strings are written, if you want to encode
before writing specify an `encoding`\&.

Example usage::

    Template('Hello {{ name }}!')\&.stream(name='foo')\&.dump('hello\&.html')

.fi
.PP
 
